  "notes": "Children who are 6 by 1 April enter 1st grade in September (aged about 6½–7½), so 1st grade is listed at 7. Osnovna škola has razredna nastava (grades 1–4) and predmetna nastava (5–8). Gimnazija lasts 4 years; vocational programmes 3–4 years."
